	METHOD ae canAttackUnderwaterUnits ()Z
		COMMENT True when this unit can engage submerged targets. OrderableUnit returns false; SubmarineUnit returns this.isUnderwater(); MissileShip and AmphibiousJet return true; CustomUnit returns this.meta.canAttackUnderwaterUnits.read(this) (the per-ini LogicBoolean, evaluated against this unit). Sole caller is canTargetUnit(Unit), which selects it in the "am.isUnderwater()" branch alongside canAttackFlyingUnits() for air and canAttackLandUnits() otherwise. Paired with canAttackNotTouchingWaterUnits(), which gates the land branch.
