	METHOD am getMeleeEngagementDistance ()F
		COMMENT Extra target-search range granted to a melee unit; 0 when not melee. getTargetSearchRange(boolean) adds it to the base range in the default (non outOfRange/guardArea/aggressive) branch, so a melee unit keeps chasing inside its engagement band. OrderableUnit returns 0.0F; CustomUnit returns this.meta.eG, which the loader fills from [attack]meleeEngangementDistance and forces to 250.0F when [attack]isMelee is true (throwing if the key is used without isMelee).
	METHOD aM getWhenBeingBuiltMakeTransparentTill ()F
	METHOD an isAggressiveAttackMode ()Z
	METHOD aN buildDrawPaint ()Landroid/graphics/Paint;
		COMMENT Paint used to draw the unit body sprite; it encodes the unit's current visual state as a colour plus an optional PorterDuffColorFilter. Built by combining: (1) a damage/elevation tint via this.l(float) applied when eq \\u003c -0.3, (2) a translucent green construction tint scaled by cm / getWhenBeingBuiltMakeTransparentTill() while the unit is still being built, (3) status tints for the on-fire (cs) and damaged (ct) flags, and (4) aO() as the alpha flag. Consumers include draw(float), GameUtils.drawTurret and Helicopter.draw. CustomUnit simply returns super.buildDrawPaint(), so custom units inherit the same body tinting.
