	METHOD aU getMaxAttackRange ()F
		COMMENT Effective maximum attack range after per-turret range limiting. OrderableUnit returns this.m() (no extra limit); CustomUnit returns this.meta.dJ, which the loader computes as maxAttackRange (cL.i) clamped down to the smallest turret limitingRange. Used by p(Unit) (the "effective range vs a specific target", adding radius + this.cj when melee) and therefore by q(Unit) when estimating artillery scatter. Contrast m(), which reports the raw declared range.
